    "title": "Hiring Store Manager at Khadim's Capital India",
    "description": "Grow your career with Khadim's Capital India! We are hiring a Store Manager for our Madurai team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout Khadim's Capital India:\nKhadim's Capital India is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage shrinkage and reduce stock discrepancies\n• Ensure visual merchandising standards are maintained at all times\n• Monitor inventory levels and coordinate replenishment activities\n• Coordinate with the supply chain team for timely stock delivery\n• Conduct regular stock audits and prevent pilferage\n• Implement promotional activities and in-store campaigns\n• Train and motivate the sales team to deliver excellent service\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Retail Analytics\n• Proficiency in CRM\n• Proficiency in Retail Operations\n• Proficiency in KPI Management\n• Proficiency in Loyalty Programs\n• Proficiency in Shrinkage Control\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in Visual Merchandising\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Madurai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Khadim's Capital India!",
